{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror game about paranoia and anxiety.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live alone in an apartment where strange things are happening. You can hear things in your walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out your daily tasks and chores whilst listening out for strange noises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock on the walls to try and find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen close for breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill them with your axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to sleep, if it is safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person interaction and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to knock on different surfaces to listen out for hidden people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ways to track down and identify people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2227050?t=1759622477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2227050?t=1759622477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227050/4c67637beb709f5be79b23df7bb91060817ca4f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759622477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227050/4c67637beb709f5be79b23df7bb91060817ca4f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759622477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Some non gory violence and reference to blood e.g. blood can be seen on the floor."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror game about paranoia and anxiety.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live alone in an apartment where strange things are happening. You can hear things in your walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out your daily tasks and chores whilst listening out for strange noises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock on the walls to try and find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen close for breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill them with your axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to sleep, if it is safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person interaction and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to knock on different surfaces to listen out for hidden people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ways to track down and identify people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["bad_ideas_digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227050/e56dfbace2b1abdf8c6f2301f263ca816db6ec72/header.jpg?t=1759622477","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"There are people in your walls","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["bad_ideas_digital"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descript